'''Knuckles''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BJCP]] and [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 805
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Knuckles
|name2 = Knuckles & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Knuckles & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Knuckles is a high‑HP, speedy midranger with very high DPS. The main issue plaguing this unit is his [[Multi-Hit|Multi‑Hit]], which interferes with his rather low DPH. Despite this, he is cheap and has enough bulk to tank a good number of attacks for his cost. His [[Immune to Weaken|Immunity to Weaken]] and [[Immune to Waves|Immunity to Waves]] are somewhat situational, but can make him a decent soft counter to stages featuring [[Berserkory]]/[[Hannya]]. Due to the lack of notable matchups beyond these two enemies, these abilities mainly serve to make him viable in certain mixed stages relying on ability spam.

Knuckles is better used on [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] or [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]‑heavy stages—like [[Red Passions (Insane)]], [[Frontier Shrine (Merciless)/Zombie|Necro Frontier]], [[Rotten Refuge]], or [[Ancestral Ways]]—that don't feature many other traits. This is especially true given his somewhat long recharge time, nearly two whole minutes.

Overall, he's a solid midranger who remains useful until late/endgame.

